255
00:11:16,743 --> 00:11:18,451
You didn’t hear anything!
Did I say anything?

256
00:11:18,476 --> 00:11:19,141
I didn’t say anything!

257
00:11:19,166 --> 00:11:20,032
He didn’t –

258
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:22,074
We didn’t hear anything!

259
00:11:22,205 --> 00:11:23,338
That’s what they said!

260
00:11:24,822 --> 00:11:27,068
Can she hear my thoughts?

261
00:11:28,896 --> 00:11:30,396
Let’s test it.

262
00:11:30,420 --> 00:11:31,454
Ah!

263
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:33,827
Disturbing.

264
00:11:34,140 --> 00:11:35,386
Disturbing.

265
00:11:36,214 --> 00:11:39,308
Wow! Sounds like! Almost!

266
00:11:39,789 --> 00:11:41,289
That’s what you said!

267
00:11:41,314 --> 00:11:45,228
I said, “disturbing.”
Exactly, that one!

268
00:11:45,253 --> 00:11:47,483
Ah! Disturb–ing!

269
00:11:47,508 --> 00:11:49,042
Oh! That’s the one!

270
00:11:49,610 --> 00:11:51,637
You picked it up from my thoughts!

271
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,990
Exactly!

272
00:11:53,260 --> 00:11:56,254
Huh?! How’d you know that?

273
00:11:57,068 --> 00:11:59,121
Oh no, Goms, you’re not allowed!

274
00:11:59,292 --> 00:12:01,132
Why not? Tso K,
what’s the reason?

275
00:12:01,369 --> 00:12:03,275
Don’t you already
work at the rice store?

276
00:12:03,300 --> 00:12:04,022
Yes, I do.

277
00:12:04,047 --> 00:12:05,755
So why are you applying here?

278
00:12:05,794 --> 00:12:07,768
I was hoping to do
this as a side gig.

279
00:12:07,934 --> 00:12:09,680
Side gig? Not possible.

280
00:12:09,842 --> 00:12:12,768
In massage work, you use
your hands, not your mouth!

281
00:12:13,375 --> 00:12:14,438
Really?

282
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,580
Okay, go on, leave now.

283
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:19,087
As a judge.

284
00:12:19,112 --> 00:12:19,886
Tso K, even just his mouth though.

285
00:12:19,911 --> 00:12:21,046
This Goms, seriously.

286
00:12:22,341 --> 00:12:23,494
Hey, Grandpa…

287
00:12:24,269 --> 00:12:25,656
‘Lo, why? What’s…?

288
00:12:25,864 --> 00:12:29,564
Oh no, Grandpa,
please don’t come here.

289
00:12:29,778 --> 00:12:32,365
You get the ID
from the barangay.

290
00:12:32,451 --> 00:12:37,918
No! I’m applying, I can
totally give massages!

291
00:12:37,943 --> 00:12:40,183
Oh no, ‘Lo, please don’t.

292
00:12:40,227 --> 00:12:41,393
Not here.

293
00:12:41,644 --> 00:12:43,704
It’s hard to give
massages in a wheelchair.

294
00:12:43,729 --> 00:12:44,541
Is that so?

295
00:12:44,566 --> 00:12:45,230
Yes.

296
00:12:45,554 --> 00:12:47,500
Alright, Grandpa, sorry.

297
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:50,173
- Careful now.
- Careful.

298
00:12:50,198 --> 00:12:54,153
- He probably needs help, Tso K.
- ‘Lo… are you okay?

299
00:12:54,178 --> 00:12:55,645
- Careful.
- I got this!

300
00:12:56,835 --> 00:12:57,788
Bye, Grandpa!

301
00:12:57,813 --> 00:12:59,394
You all look like
you’re giving birth!

302
00:12:59,419 --> 00:13:01,452
He still has that
spark. Just kidding.

303
00:13:01,477 --> 00:13:02,552
Ay! Might be arthritis.

304
00:13:03,706 --> 00:13:05,801
- Tso K!
- Oh no!

305
00:13:05,826 --> 00:13:07,434
Hey, how are you?

306
00:13:07,867 --> 00:13:08,787
Here I am!

307
00:13:08,812 --> 00:13:13,360
You’ve got some nerve
applying here, huh?

308
00:13:13,741 --> 00:13:16,356
Hey, Tso K, didn’t you
want Andres to have a job?

309
00:13:16,381 --> 00:13:18,242
What’s so bad
about him applying?

310
00:13:18,293 --> 00:13:22,022
For Anne, I’ll do whatever I can.

311
00:13:22,047 --> 00:13:23,507
No! I’m not hiring you!

312
00:13:23,532 --> 00:13:25,807
Ay… ay! Tso K, come on,
just give Andres a shot!

313
00:13:25,845 --> 00:13:28,450
- It’s just a trial anyway, right?
- Yeah!

314
00:13:28,479 --> 00:13:32,419
- And he can be trained!
- Right, right, right, right?!

315
00:13:32,444 --> 00:13:33,930
- Yes!
- Yeah!

316
00:13:33,976 --> 00:13:35,516
- Oh!
- Exactly!

317
00:13:38,094 --> 00:13:41,154
Actually, if I hire him,

318
00:13:41,474 --> 00:13:42,860
I can make things hard for him.

319
00:13:43,686 --> 00:13:45,260
Sweet revenge.

320
00:13:46,672 --> 00:13:47,495
Alright!

321
00:13:48,198 --> 00:13:49,212
- Really?!
- You’re hired!

322
00:13:49,237 --> 00:13:50,001
Really?!

323
00:13:51,646 --> 00:13:53,840
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

324
00:13:53,865 --> 00:13:56,372
You’re in for the next challenge.

325
00:13:56,397 --> 00:13:56,822
Cha–?

326
00:13:56,847 --> 00:13:57,769
- What?
- Challenge?

327
00:13:58,153 --> 00:13:59,395
What challenge, Tso K?

328
00:13:59,830 --> 00:14:00,736
Of course!

329
00:14:00,761 --> 00:14:03,248
Let the SpaKarlTan
Challenge begin!

330
00:14:07,346 --> 00:14:11,987
Good thing it looks like we’ve
got customers at the bakery, right?

331
00:14:15,030 --> 00:14:17,677
- What? What happened?
- Kuya Aga!

332
00:14:17,702 --> 00:14:20,787
Wow. Tita Cha,
Tito Aga, Lola Maxi,

333
00:14:20,812 --> 00:14:21,859
cousin Andy…

334
00:14:23,183 --> 00:14:24,043
It’s Tash!

335
00:14:24,068 --> 00:14:25,201
Tash is unbelievable!

336
00:14:25,226 --> 00:14:28,130
- Do you know the latest about her?
- What? What’s the latest?

337
00:14:28,155 --> 00:14:29,449
She can read minds.

338
00:14:29,566 --> 00:14:30,673
Believe us.

339
00:14:30,698 --> 00:14:32,308
She can read minds,
she hears them.

340
00:14:32,333 --> 00:14:35,047
Then she says it, and it
happens. So much happened!

341
00:14:35,072 --> 00:14:37,754
You mean, Tash has superpowers?!

342
00:14:37,779 --> 00:14:38,868
Yes, Lola Maxi!

343
00:14:38,893 --> 00:14:42,065
If that’s true, that’s a
great business idea!

344
00:14:42,995 --> 00:14:46,288
Come on, stop it with
the superpowers talk.

345
00:14:46,399 --> 00:14:47,492
That’s not real!

346
00:14:47,603 --> 00:14:50,031
Right! Aga’s right.

347
00:14:50,253 --> 00:14:53,220
You know, maybe you just
want us to fight with Atasha.

348
00:14:53,381 --> 00:14:55,361
So let’s call a
ceasefire for now, okay?

349
00:14:55,405 --> 00:14:56,505
Of course not, Tita.

350
00:14:56,530 --> 00:14:57,167
Not you!

351
00:14:57,192 --> 00:14:58,862
Tita? You’re calling me Tita?!

352
00:14:58,926 --> 00:15:00,246
You’re my favorite
Tita, you know!

353
00:15:00,271 --> 00:15:01,919
What do you mean Tita?!

354
00:15:02,736 --> 00:15:03,450
Right?!

355
00:15:03,475 --> 00:15:05,433
If you don’t want to
believe us, that’s up to you.

356
00:15:06,408 --> 00:15:07,559
Oh cousin…

357
00:15:07,697 --> 00:15:08,910
It’s okay, cousin.

358
00:15:09,909 --> 00:15:11,130
Superpowers?!

359
00:15:11,163 --> 00:15:12,582
There she is! She’s here!

360
00:15:12,607 --> 00:15:14,706
Superpowers, is it true?!

361
00:15:15,136 --> 00:15:17,182
Anyway, Tash, get some rest first.

362
00:15:17,214 --> 00:15:20,275
And if you feel anything else,
don’t hesitate to tell us, okay?

363
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,520
Alright, thank you, Doc.

364
00:15:21,752 --> 00:15:22,279
Thank you!

365
00:15:22,304 --> 00:15:24,608
- Doc, doc, wait a sec!
- Yes?

366
00:15:24,633 --> 00:15:26,427
Just a quick question.

367
00:15:26,452 --> 00:15:27,020
Yes, Lola?

368
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:28,286
Is it possible that when

369
00:15:28,406 --> 00:15:31,659
someone gets electrocuted,
they gain superpowers?

370
00:15:32,235 --> 00:15:35,509
Lola, seriously, you still
believe in superpowers?

371
00:15:35,924 --> 00:15:37,057
Didn’t I ask the question?

372
00:15:37,082 --> 00:15:39,094
Oh! So you’ve seen it now?

373
00:15:39,438 --> 00:15:41,731
There are no superpowers!

374
00:15:41,756 --> 00:15:43,328
Not real at all.

375
00:15:43,912 --> 00:15:45,299
Anyway, I have to go.

376
00:15:45,324 --> 00:15:46,830
- Doctor!
- I’ll go ahead.

377
00:15:46,855 --> 00:15:48,531
- Thank you, Doc!
- Thank you!

378
00:15:48,556 --> 00:15:49,586
Just call if you need
anything, Atasha, okay?

379
00:15:49,611 --> 00:15:50,106
Alright.

380
00:15:50,131 --> 00:15:51,889
- Bye-bye! Thank you, doctor!
- Thank you so much!

381
00:15:51,914 --> 00:15:53,093
Thanks!

382
00:15:53,396 --> 00:15:55,469
So there really aren’t
any superpowers.

383
00:15:55,494 --> 00:15:58,163
…that superpower stuff.

384
00:15:58,188 --> 00:16:03,100
Okay, Aga, don’t look,
don’t look, they’ll notice!

385
00:16:03,708 --> 00:16:06,208
Those girls are stunning!

386
00:16:06,233 --> 00:16:08,789
So fair-skinned! So sexy!

387
00:16:08,814 --> 00:16:11,738
I want to get a
massage from them later!

388
00:16:14,366 --> 00:16:15,919
Are Dad and I thinking
the same thing?

389
00:16:21,268 --> 00:16:26,529
Dad said – I don’t
want to say it, Mom –

390
00:16:26,613 --> 00:16:27,593
What is it?

391
00:16:27,618 --> 00:16:29,746
Those three girls who walked
by, the massage therapists,

392
00:16:29,865 --> 00:16:32,325
they’re really sexy
and fair-skinned.

393
00:16:32,556 --> 00:16:33,756
Then Andres said…

394
00:16:33,781 --> 00:16:35,080
- Huh?
- He wants that too!

395
00:16:35,166 --> 00:16:36,833
- Wants what?
- That Dad’s right!

396
00:16:36,858 --> 00:16:37,951
Dad’s right about what?

397
00:16:37,976 --> 00:16:38,866
- He wants that too?
- Are you sure?

398
00:16:38,891 --> 00:16:40,205
- What?
- They want to try it!

399
00:16:40,230 --> 00:16:42,595
- She’s the one with superp–
- What super–?!

400
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:42,973
Hey!

401
00:16:42,998 --> 00:16:45,019
You’re the only one with a
superpower to mispronounce words!

402
00:16:45,531 --> 00:16:46,204
What?!

403
00:16:46,229 --> 00:16:48,460
What nonsense are
you even saying?!

404
00:16:48,485 --> 00:16:50,651
I didn’t say anything like that!

405
00:16:50,883 --> 00:16:53,054
- Did I even think that?!
- Nothing! I didn’t –

406
00:16:53,079 --> 00:16:53,953
See?! See that?!

407
00:16:54,597 --> 00:16:58,034
What I said was, you’re the
fair one, you’re the sexy one.

408
00:16:58,059 --> 00:16:59,690
You’re… you’re the only one…

409
00:17:17,051 --> 00:17:18,056
What is that?!

410
00:17:18,786 --> 00:17:20,589
No pressure at all!

411
00:17:20,711 --> 00:17:22,644
What kind of hands are those?!

412
00:17:22,669 --> 00:17:25,605
How are you going
to protect my niece

413
00:17:25,772 --> 00:17:27,679
if just from my hands,
you’ve got no energy?

414
00:17:28,346 --> 00:17:29,366
You know what, if I were you,

415
00:17:29,463 --> 00:17:30,870
I’d just go back to the bakery.

416
00:17:31,116 --> 00:17:32,949
- Ah, Tso K, Tso K…
- Just knead some dough.

417
00:17:32,974 --> 00:17:34,002
Go on, go.

418
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,505
You’ve got this, Andres!

419
00:17:35,643 --> 00:17:37,323
Just imagine someone
kidnapped Anne,

420
00:17:37,348 --> 00:17:39,158
but I’m not telling you who.

421
00:17:39,183 --> 00:17:41,956
Right, he’s wearing a
gray polo with leafy designs!

422
00:17:41,981 --> 00:17:44,908
Yeah, and his
face is so annoying!

423
00:17:44,965 --> 00:17:45,978
Super annoying!

424
00:17:46,003 --> 00:17:46,803
When you see him, you
just wanna punch him!

425
00:17:46,828 --> 00:17:48,114
Definitely gonna punch him!

426
00:17:49,495 --> 00:17:50,144
Right!

427
00:17:50,169 --> 00:17:52,329
I won’t let this happen!
I’ll save you, Anne!

428
00:17:53,138 --> 00:17:54,057
Hey!

429
00:17:54,347 --> 00:17:56,207
Let’s go! Let’s go!

430
00:17:56,713 --> 00:17:58,073
Okay, right pressure!

431
00:17:58,098 --> 00:17:59,610
Push! Push!

432
00:17:59,635 --> 00:18:01,458
Ow, ow, ow! That hurts!

433
00:18:01,483 --> 00:18:09,223
Now I’ll teach you the right
pressure, technique, and rhythm!

434
00:18:09,556 --> 00:18:10,156
Rhythm!

435
00:18:10,181 --> 00:18:13,563
- Pressure, technique, rhythm!
- Rhythm!

436
00:18:13,588 --> 00:18:14,866
- Rhythm!
- What was that, British?

437
00:18:14,891 --> 00:18:17,268
Here on the – head massage.

438
00:18:17,293 --> 00:18:19,161
- Massage!
- That’s it!

439
00:18:19,285 --> 00:18:20,289
Vet!

440
00:18:21,149 --> 00:18:23,479
- You’ll start here, okay?
- Oh, wow. Wow.

441
00:18:23,504 --> 00:18:26,108
- On the back, alright?
- Wow! Wow!

442
00:18:26,133 --> 00:18:29,804
- There… then it goes down…
- Okay…

443
00:18:30,579 --> 00:18:33,039
Goes down to the shoulders.

444
00:18:35,127 --> 00:18:36,247
So that’s how it’s supposed to be!

445
00:18:36,279 --> 00:18:38,251
Here, on the blades…

446
00:18:38,555 --> 00:18:39,823
Okay...

447
00:18:39,848 --> 00:18:41,758
W-w-wait, Tso K!

448
00:18:41,878 --> 00:18:43,785
I thought you were
teaching a head massage—

449
00:18:43,810 --> 00:18:45,616
why are you
heading to the chest?!

450
00:18:45,946 --> 00:18:47,556
- Yeah, right?!
- Don’t butt in!

451
00:18:47,857 --> 00:18:49,531
What do you mean “yeah, right”?!

452
00:18:49,598 --> 00:18:50,924
There’s nothing
dirty here, okay!

453
00:18:51,082 --> 00:18:52,482
This is purely professional!

454
00:18:52,593 --> 00:18:55,253
- Professional?
- Oh, professional!

455
00:18:55,278 --> 00:18:56,438
Okay…?

456
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:58,920
Do you feel it?

457
00:18:59,749 --> 00:19:01,029
It’s light.

458
00:19:01,141 --> 00:19:03,368
Just feel the pressure.

459
00:19:03,393 --> 00:19:05,318
- Something feels off.
- Are you okay?

460
00:19:05,363 --> 00:19:07,511
Let the energy flow
through your whole body.

461
00:19:07,536 --> 00:19:09,048
- Tso K! Tso K!
- Guys, guys!

462
00:19:09,078 --> 00:19:10,662
- Help, help!
- Tso K, that’s enough.

463
00:19:10,694 --> 00:19:12,314
- Help, please.
- Tso K, stop it.

464
00:19:12,339 --> 00:19:14,483
- He already gets it, he gets it!
- What?!

465
00:19:14,673 --> 00:19:16,159
He gets it, now it’s my turn!

466
00:19:16,184 --> 00:19:17,676
- What are you talking about?!
- Kidding! Just kidding!

467
00:19:17,701 --> 00:19:18,743
This is getting inappropriate!

468
00:19:18,768 --> 00:19:19,871
This is a training session!

469
00:19:19,896 --> 00:19:21,306
Why are you interfering?!

470
00:19:21,331 --> 00:19:23,810
No, it’s just—he
already gets the rhythm—

471
00:19:23,835 --> 00:19:27,787
I’m the owner of the
spa! SpaKarl, remember?!

472
00:19:28,049 --> 00:19:29,649
So I make the rules here!

473
00:19:30,266 --> 00:19:31,166
You all stop it!

474
00:19:31,416 --> 00:19:35,169
- I’m not stopping!
- Okay… guys, help me!

475
00:19:35,194 --> 00:19:36,643
It’s okay now, he’s
gone professional!

476
00:19:36,668 --> 00:19:38,064
He’s professional now!

477
00:19:43,131 --> 00:19:46,199
You look amazing, Tash!
Oh my gosh! You’re all set!

478
00:19:46,341 --> 00:19:47,708
Perfect!

479
00:19:47,778 --> 00:19:50,012
Are you sure I don’t
look ridiculous in this?

480
00:19:50,089 --> 00:19:51,516
- What? No way!
- No!

481
00:19:51,541 --> 00:19:52,549
Of course you need this.

482
00:19:52,574 --> 00:19:55,273
You need a costume so you’ll
look like a legit mind-reader.

483
00:19:55,298 --> 00:19:55,826
Okay!

484
00:19:55,851 --> 00:19:58,965
Actually, you could
be in a commercial.

485
00:19:58,990 --> 00:19:59,496
Actually!

486
00:19:59,521 --> 00:20:00,058
Right?

487
00:20:00,373 --> 00:20:02,066
Try a shampoo commercial!

488
00:20:02,091 --> 00:20:02,637
Yeah!

489
00:20:02,662 --> 00:20:05,339
- Totally!
- You sure?

490
00:20:05,364 --> 00:20:05,807
You look amazing!

491
00:20:05,935 --> 00:20:07,454
Alright, fine, let’s do this.

492
00:20:07,479 --> 00:20:11,421
You know what, Boss Beauty,
looks like we’re gonna make a lot.

493
00:20:12,443 --> 00:20:16,590
Of course, of course! I
got you, you won’t lose out!

494
00:20:17,406 --> 00:20:18,706
But you won’t gain
anything either!

495
00:20:19,543 --> 00:20:20,956
Boss Beauty!

496
00:20:22,280 --> 00:20:23,720
- Oh, a customer!
- What can I do for you?

497
00:20:23,802 --> 00:20:25,448
Can you read minds?

498
00:20:25,563 --> 00:20:27,043
Oh, you’re here
for a mind reading?

499
00:20:27,068 --> 00:20:28,386
Sorry, though—

500
00:20:28,815 --> 00:20:30,815
we’re only reading
men’s minds today.

501
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:33,224
Yup! My husband here!

502
00:20:33,249 --> 00:20:35,956
Wait! You said you were
getting your mind read—why me?!

503
00:20:36,980 --> 00:20:38,467
- Come on already!
- Hold on, hold on!

504
00:20:38,492 --> 00:20:40,702
Have a seat, sir!

505
00:20:40,770 --> 00:20:42,610
Boss Beauty, here’s my payment.

506
00:20:42,635 --> 00:20:43,768
Thank you!

507
00:20:43,793 --> 00:20:45,229
Look that way, Tash.

508
00:20:45,254 --> 00:20:46,548
Hey, Boss Beauty,
don’t forget my cut, okay?

509
00:20:46,573 --> 00:20:47,553
I got you!

510
00:20:47,738 --> 00:20:48,695
You okay?

511
00:20:49,076 --> 00:20:50,006
You sure?

512
00:20:50,356 --> 00:20:52,315
Alright, this will
be quick, alright?

513
00:20:52,604 --> 00:20:54,131
Tash, she already
paid, five hundred!

514
00:20:54,156 --> 00:20:54,801
Alright.

515
00:20:54,833 --> 00:20:55,795
We’ve got five hundred now!

516
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:57,509
I’m gonna give it
my best, I swear.

517
00:20:57,534 --> 00:20:58,604
It’s one-five, though!

518
00:21:05,786 --> 00:21:07,439
Hope she doesn’t find out

519
00:21:07,464 --> 00:21:09,844
I went on a date last
night with our housemaid.

520
00:21:11,894 --> 00:21:14,701
He went on a date last
night with your housemaid!

521
00:21:15,340 --> 00:21:15,940
Huh?!

522
00:21:15,965 --> 00:21:18,093
I knew it!

523
00:21:18,248 --> 00:21:20,209
That’s why the
house is always dirty—

524
00:21:20,234 --> 00:21:21,767
because you’re the
one she cleans up!

525
00:21:21,792 --> 00:21:23,600
You’re in big trouble!

526
00:21:25,595 --> 00:21:26,595
[chattering]

527
00:21:27,791 --> 00:21:30,811
Andres! You ready
for the next challenge?

528
00:21:31,031 --> 00:21:31,898
Of course, Tso K!

529
00:21:31,923 --> 00:21:34,610
Whatever it is, let’s crush it!

530
00:21:35,476 --> 00:21:37,083
- Uh…
- This is…

531
00:21:37,108 --> 00:21:38,170
That.

532
00:21:38,626 --> 00:21:43,307
That’s our client, and she’s
the one you’ll massage.

533
00:21:43,332 --> 00:21:44,350
Her?

534
00:21:45,613 --> 00:21:48,010
OMG, Tso K! What if
you break Lola’s bones?!

535
00:21:48,035 --> 00:21:48,868
Eh, that’s fine.

536
00:21:48,893 --> 00:21:50,405
If he breaks her,
then he goes to jail.

537
00:21:50,430 --> 00:21:51,590
- Huh?!
- What?!

538
00:21:51,615 --> 00:21:52,885
Ah, I mean—what I meant was,

539
00:21:53,097 --> 00:21:55,644
you can’t just use full force.

540
00:21:55,682 --> 00:21:57,994
- You need control.
- Ah…

541
00:21:58,267 --> 00:22:00,893
Because if you’re
careless, and press wrong,

542
00:22:01,906 --> 00:22:03,064
Lola’s bones could break.

543
00:22:03,379 --> 00:22:05,763
B-but Tso K, I’m
scared. Because…

544
00:22:06,263 --> 00:22:10,155
Andres! Andres,
you’ve got this—for Anne!

545
00:22:11,475 --> 00:22:12,586
Right!

546
00:22:14,768 --> 00:22:18,138
Ah, okay… Alright, let’s go in, Lola.

547
00:22:18,739 --> 00:22:21,056
Go for it!

548
00:22:21,358 --> 00:22:22,215
Let’s go!

549
00:22:22,453 --> 00:22:23,653
You got this, do your best!

550
00:22:23,766 --> 00:22:24,568
Let’s go!

551
00:22:24,593 --> 00:22:25,385
Let’s go!

552
00:22:29,065 --> 00:22:30,178
That sounded strong?!

553
00:22:30,451 --> 00:22:31,368
What was that?!

554
00:22:31,893 --> 00:22:33,373
That was bone, obviously!

555
00:22:33,398 --> 00:22:34,801
They might be eating
chicharon in there, girl.

556
00:22:34,826 --> 00:22:35,474
Chicharon?

557
00:22:35,499 --> 00:22:36,658
You got chicharon in there?

558
00:22:36,683 --> 00:22:37,442
Nope!

559
00:22:37,467 --> 00:22:38,248
Really now?

560
00:22:39,011 --> 00:22:40,331
- Oh!
- That was crispy!

561
00:22:40,563 --> 00:22:42,897
- So crispy!
- Crunchy!

562
00:22:44,011 --> 00:22:45,865
What’s going on in there, girl?

563
00:22:46,899 --> 00:22:51,492
Like they say, the last laugh’s mine!

564
00:22:51,664 --> 00:22:54,271
Where is she? Check it out!

565
00:22:57,614 --> 00:22:59,060
What’s going on?

566
00:22:59,085 --> 00:23:01,167
Why are there so many
people? Is a celebrity here?

567
00:23:01,757 --> 00:23:03,637
Lola, it’s just me.

568
00:23:05,147 --> 00:23:07,760
Lola, this Tash here—

569
00:23:07,864 --> 00:23:10,917
whatever our customers are just
thinking, she’s already blurting it out!

570
00:23:12,481 --> 00:23:14,694
I know… you’re
jealous, aren’t you?

571
00:23:14,820 --> 00:23:15,481
Me?

572
00:23:15,653 --> 00:23:16,200
Mmm.

573
00:23:16,238 --> 00:23:17,211
- Jealous?
- Yup.

574
00:23:17,759 --> 00:23:20,119
- No way.
- Yes, way!

575
00:23:20,303 --> 00:23:20,983
See?

576
00:23:21,021 --> 00:23:24,575
At least we’re putting Atasha’s
superpowers to good use, right?

577
00:23:25,052 --> 00:23:27,965
B-but… it feels kind of wrong.

578
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:37,236
I mean… isn’t it like you’re
invading someone’s mind?

579
00:23:38,632 --> 00:23:39,726
That’s not right, is it?

580
00:23:41,014 --> 00:23:42,294
- Dad…
- Tash!

581
00:23:42,568 --> 00:23:44,275
Yes, I got this under control.

582
00:23:44,360 --> 00:23:45,340
You sure about that?

583
00:23:45,365 --> 00:23:46,604
Of course—it’s me!

584
00:23:49,576 --> 00:23:50,675
Don’t move!

585
00:23:51,042 --> 00:23:51,749
Oh no!

586
00:23:51,774 --> 00:23:53,991
This is a stick-up! Hands in the air!

587
00:23:54,021 --> 00:23:55,345
Tash! Tash! Come here!

588
00:23:55,378 --> 00:23:56,652
- Wait, Boss! Hold on!
- Atasha!

589
00:23:56,784 --> 00:23:59,144
Hope they don’t notice I
don’t actually have a gun!

590
00:24:00,819 --> 00:24:02,406
Don’t come any
closer or I’ll shoot!

591
00:24:02,994 --> 00:24:03,748
Go, Kuya Je!

592
00:24:03,785 --> 00:24:04,624
I got this!

593
00:24:04,649 --> 00:24:07,289
Nooooo!

594
00:24:07,314 --> 00:24:09,386
Cut it out, I know
your gun’s fake.

595
00:24:09,411 --> 00:24:10,086
- Huh?
- Huh?

596
00:24:10,112 --> 00:24:10,898
What?

597
00:24:10,923 --> 00:24:11,862
What the heck?!

598
00:24:12,802 --> 00:24:14,291
There! You too.

599
00:24:14,316 --> 00:24:16,553
Hey, be careful! Tash! Be careful!

600
00:24:17,185 --> 00:24:19,285
- You’re really something, seriously!
- Ah!

601
00:24:19,447 --> 00:24:20,880
You don’t even have–!

602
00:24:21,553 --> 00:24:22,986
You’re too much!

603
00:24:24,907 --> 00:24:26,434
Tasha was amazing!

604
00:24:26,945 --> 00:24:28,138
Tasha!

605
00:24:30,341 --> 00:24:32,354
Tasha! Tasha!

606
00:24:32,379 --> 00:24:34,252
Tasha! Tasha!

607
00:24:34,323 --> 00:24:36,290
Tasha! Tasha!

608
00:24:36,323 --> 00:24:37,057
Tasha!

609
00:24:37,082 --> 00:24:37,826
Think positive!

610
00:24:37,851 --> 00:24:38,950
Hey, how was it?!

611
00:24:39,623 --> 00:24:42,323
So? Should I call
a paramedic now?

612
00:24:43,173 --> 00:24:44,257
Can’t stand up anymore?

613
00:24:45,963 --> 00:24:47,185
Might’ve broken a bone!

614
00:24:47,269 --> 00:24:48,205
Lola!

615
00:24:48,713 --> 00:24:49,771
Beats me.

616
00:24:50,731 --> 00:24:51,411
Huh?

617
00:24:51,436 --> 00:24:52,725
That’s exactly what
I said would happen!

618
00:24:56,807 --> 00:24:59,000
Andres, thank you, son.

619
00:25:03,645 --> 00:25:05,378
You’re really good at massages!

620
00:25:05,564 --> 00:25:07,018
Rejuvenating!

621
00:25:08,401 --> 00:25:09,941
Y-you sure that was you, Lola?

622
00:25:10,344 --> 00:25:12,425
I feel younger and stronger!

623
00:25:13,275 --> 00:25:14,583
- Oh!
- Finally!

624
00:25:14,797 --> 00:25:16,877
I can start making
TwikTwok videos!

625
00:25:17,245 --> 00:25:19,332
- TwikTwok!
- TwikTwok!

626
00:25:19,357 --> 00:25:20,398
Yeah! That’s your cue!

627
00:25:20,438 --> 00:25:21,604
You look amazing, Lola!

628
00:25:21,629 --> 00:25:23,019
t’s like a full makeover
happened in there!

629
00:25:24,650 --> 00:25:25,548
All good! Chicharon
was all she needed!

630
00:25:25,573 --> 00:25:26,429
How did that even happen?!

631
00:25:27,810 --> 00:25:29,370
Good thing she didn’t
go for the sauna—

632
00:25:29,807 --> 00:25:31,474
she might’ve come out a baby!

633
00:25:32,058 --> 00:25:33,964
Good thing you’ll
finally see Anne again!

634
00:25:34,122 --> 00:25:35,968
Yeah! This is the
last round, Andres!

635
00:25:36,188 --> 00:25:37,588
Yeah, fight, fight!

636
00:25:37,613 --> 00:25:38,580
- Yes!
- Fght, fight!

637
00:25:38,605 --> 00:25:40,471
I really miss Anne.

638
00:25:40,858 --> 00:25:41,801
- Me too.
- Right?

639
00:25:43,346 --> 00:25:44,326
Oh, Andres!

640
00:25:45,436 --> 00:25:46,471
So, are you ready?

641
00:25:47,611 --> 00:25:49,178
Do you think you're good now?

642
00:25:49,584 --> 00:25:53,289
Tso K, I’m more than ready
for whatever challenge this is!

643
00:25:53,444 --> 00:25:57,961
Well, here’s your final challenge!

644
00:25:57,986 --> 00:25:59,241
Okay!

645
00:25:59,291 --> 00:26:02,304
Oh, there she is! Our
customer’s arriving.

646
00:26:02,329 --> 00:26:04,675
Whatever challenge it is...

647
00:26:04,734 --> 00:26:08,175
- Really?
- I’ll do it, Tso K!

648
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:09,911
Hey, man, how are you?

649
00:26:12,245 --> 00:26:13,989
- Him, him, him?
- Yup. Who else?

650
00:26:14,329 --> 00:26:15,397
He’s your customer.

651
00:26:15,657 --> 00:26:16,763
Okay, you ready?

652
00:26:17,908 --> 00:26:20,394
Oh right, Tso K, Tash
asked me to do something—

653
00:26:20,419 --> 00:26:21,134
I actually need to go home.

654
00:26:21,159 --> 00:26:22,547
I need to go home, remember?

655
00:26:22,572 --> 00:26:23,961
Uh-uh, where do you
think you’re going?

656
00:26:25,024 --> 00:26:26,292
I want a massage!

657
00:26:26,317 --> 00:26:28,123
- Oh, really?
- Come on in!

658
00:26:29,742 --> 00:26:32,196
- Careful, careful!
- Andres, you got this!

659
00:26:32,221 --> 00:26:33,763
You might be the one
giving the massage, Andres!

660
00:26:35,458 --> 00:26:38,597
Let’s see if he
makes it out of that!

661
00:26:41,225 --> 00:26:43,592
- Je, hey! How are you?
- Doc!

662
00:26:43,617 --> 00:26:45,412
All good. Is Tasha around?

663
00:26:45,437 --> 00:26:47,337
Oh, she’s not here
right now, but I’ll call her.

664
00:26:49,012 --> 00:26:51,119
Tash, the doctor’s looking for you.

665
00:26:54,144 --> 00:26:55,730
Hi, Doc! Good evening!

666
00:26:55,755 --> 00:26:57,887
Hey, Tash! How are you?

667
00:26:58,238 --> 00:27:00,052
Glad to see you're okay!

668
00:27:00,077 --> 00:27:01,573
Thank you so much.

669
00:27:02,034 --> 00:27:04,241
- This is Bert, my date.
- Hello!

670
00:27:04,266 --> 00:27:05,681
Hi, Bert! Good evening!

671
00:27:05,706 --> 00:27:07,905
Welcome to Bake Haus of U!

672
00:27:08,242 --> 00:27:10,243
This is just our humble bake shop.

673
00:27:11,314 --> 00:27:12,508
What kind of place is this?

674
00:27:12,881 --> 00:27:14,362
It looks kinda sketchy.

675
00:27:15,260 --> 00:27:16,137
What was that?

676
00:27:16,437 --> 00:27:18,590
Uh, I mean...your
place looks great!

677
00:27:19,010 --> 00:27:20,883
Simple, but classy.

678
00:27:23,651 --> 00:27:24,451
Thank you!

679
00:27:24,476 --> 00:27:29,070
Please sit down while
I grab our best seller.

680
00:27:31,015 --> 00:27:32,355
Perfect, thank you!

681
00:27:33,792 --> 00:27:35,299
Let’s ask what their best seller is.

682
00:27:35,592 --> 00:27:36,438
- Je!
- Yes?

683
00:27:36,463 --> 00:27:37,849
What’s the best seller here?

684
00:27:37,874 --> 00:27:38,973
What would you recommend?

685
00:27:38,998 --> 00:27:41,719
Oh, you have to try Lola’s pan de regla—

686
00:27:41,744 --> 00:27:42,987
it’s been around since 1983.

687
00:27:43,172 --> 00:27:44,001
Oh!

688
00:27:44,565 --> 00:27:46,265
- Let’s do it!
- Let’s try!

689
00:27:46,374 --> 00:27:47,854
Go on! Go check it out!

690
00:27:49,074 --> 00:27:49,528
Oh?

691
00:27:49,553 --> 00:27:50,447
Let’s see!

692
00:27:51,031 --> 00:27:52,171
You’re on a different
level with that massage!

693
00:27:52,196 --> 00:27:52,982
Whoa!

694
00:27:53,715 --> 00:27:54,742
Thanks, okay?

695
00:27:56,594 --> 00:27:57,794
What just happened?

696
00:27:58,042 --> 00:27:59,649
What did you do to your body?

697
00:27:59,862 --> 00:28:00,822
Why does it feel like that?

698
00:28:00,922 --> 00:28:01,615
Right?!

699
00:28:01,975 --> 00:28:02,784
Of course!

700
00:28:03,334 --> 00:28:04,574
I crushed all the tension out!

701
00:28:04,781 --> 00:28:05,754
- Tension?
- Tension?

702
00:28:06,111 --> 00:28:08,410
Wait—so all that was
just tension?! Tension?!

703
00:28:09,355 --> 00:28:10,649
- Wow!
- Thank you!

704
00:28:11,786 --> 00:28:13,352
- So it was just tension...
- Just tension...

705
00:28:13,377 --> 00:28:14,532
Francis, your turn!

706
00:28:14,557 --> 00:28:15,763
That guy’s a fraud!

707
00:28:16,071 --> 00:28:18,417
He was just sleeping
in oil all that time!

708
00:28:18,966 --> 00:28:20,026
That might not even be him!

709
00:28:20,051 --> 00:28:20,951
No, really!

710
00:28:21,898 --> 00:28:23,678
Well…Tso K,

711
00:28:24,168 --> 00:28:28,488
I did your challenge,
and I passed too.

712
00:28:32,704 --> 00:28:33,816
So good!

713
00:28:38,047 --> 00:28:38,808
Try it!

714
00:28:38,833 --> 00:28:40,140
- You try it!
- That’s Lola’s favorite!

715
00:28:41,408 --> 00:28:42,762
It’s limited edition! That one—

716
00:28:46,785 --> 00:28:47,655
Delicious!

717
00:28:48,522 --> 00:28:49,769
You baked this, Tash?

718
00:28:49,875 --> 00:28:50,609
Yes!

719
00:28:50,634 --> 00:28:51,554
Here’s your coffee, Doc!

720
00:28:51,603 --> 00:28:52,511
Thanks.

721
00:28:53,289 --> 00:28:54,315
Here you go, sir.

722
00:28:56,647 --> 00:28:59,561
That one’s good
too—it’s Yaya’s piyaya.

723
00:29:00,825 --> 00:29:02,198
It’s really good.

724
00:29:04,006 --> 00:29:07,405
Perfect with coffee—so I
can slip in the sleeping drug.

725
00:29:07,800 --> 00:29:10,014
I’ve been waiting a
long time for this, Doc.

726
00:29:10,230 --> 00:29:13,430
This time, I’ll make sure you’re mine.

727
00:29:16,485 --> 00:29:17,480
Wait, Doc…

728
00:29:17,875 --> 00:29:21,004
no, no, no… he
has bad intentions.

729
00:29:21,754 --> 00:29:23,614
He wants to put
something in your drink.

730
00:29:24,167 --> 00:29:25,840
I knew it!

731
00:29:25,986 --> 00:29:27,587
That’s why I never
gave you a chance!

732
00:29:28,385 --> 00:29:29,612
He’s crazy!

733
00:29:29,703 --> 00:29:31,063
I’m not even saying anything!

734
00:29:34,014 --> 00:29:36,534
Tash, is there a problem?

735
00:29:36,594 --> 00:29:37,641
I’ll handle this.

736
00:29:39,409 --> 00:29:41,082
Don’t worry, cousin.

737
00:29:41,559 --> 00:29:43,033
Even if we’re fighting right now,

738
00:29:43,254 --> 00:29:44,508
I won’t let anything
happen to you.

739
00:29:45,460 --> 00:29:47,900
No, no, no, let me
handle it. I can do this.

740
00:29:48,020 --> 00:29:48,640
Are you sure?

741
00:29:48,665 --> 00:29:50,087
This is nothing.

742
00:29:50,564 --> 00:29:51,489
Alright.

743
00:29:55,480 --> 00:30:00,507
You little brat! You
always get in the way!

744
00:30:00,703 --> 00:30:01,720
This is what you deserve!

745
00:30:04,659 --> 00:30:06,872
Tash! Tash! Tash! Tash! Tash!

746
00:30:07,756 --> 00:30:08,573
Wait a sec.

747
00:30:09,256 --> 00:30:10,033
You!

748
00:30:12,430 --> 00:30:14,097
Hey! Tash! Tash!

749
00:30:15,485 --> 00:30:17,765
Wow! That was awesome!

750
00:30:20,199 --> 00:30:21,526
Hold on, let’s piece it together.

751
00:30:21,741 --> 00:30:23,334
Wow, amazing!

752
00:30:23,447 --> 00:30:25,014
This kid’s really talented.

753
00:30:28,246 --> 00:30:29,061
Hey!

754
00:30:29,583 --> 00:30:30,809
W-what happened?

755
00:30:31,464 --> 00:30:33,784
Where’s Kuya Je?

756
00:30:34,049 --> 00:30:35,065
Tash, I’m here.

757
00:30:37,994 --> 00:30:39,234
Wait, where’s that Bert guy?

758
00:30:39,562 --> 00:30:41,849
He’s gone, Tash. They took
him to the barangay office.

759
00:30:42,028 --> 00:30:43,055
Thanks to you.

760
00:30:43,080 --> 00:30:45,614
If it weren’t for you, I
might’ve been in real danger

761
00:30:46,064 --> 00:30:47,251
Oh, it’s nothing, Doc.

762
00:30:47,337 --> 00:30:49,304
Actually, Kuya
Je’s the real hero.

763
00:30:50,361 --> 00:30:51,788
It’s all because of him.

764
00:30:53,605 --> 00:30:54,785
Thank you, Kuya Je.

765
00:30:56,528 --> 00:30:57,527
Thank you, Doc.

766
00:30:57,783 --> 00:31:01,596
Tash, I’m just really
glad you’re okay.

767
00:31:02,296 --> 00:31:05,241
I have to go now, I’ve
still got rounds to do.

768
00:31:05,266 --> 00:31:07,646
- You still have rounds?
- Alright, Doc, thank you!

769
00:31:07,671 --> 00:31:09,425
- Thank you so much!
- Thanks, Doc!

770
00:31:09,450 --> 00:31:11,102
- Thank you so much!
- Bye, Doc! Take care!

771
00:31:11,127 --> 00:31:12,008
Thanks, Doc!

772
00:31:12,033 --> 00:31:13,621
Doc, my cheek
though—next time, okay?

773
00:31:14,194 --> 00:31:16,185
See? Told you.

774
00:31:16,628 --> 00:31:19,061
At the end of the day, it’s
still family helping family.

775
00:31:19,862 --> 00:31:21,115
That’s how it ends.

776
00:31:21,140 --> 00:31:24,567
Well, I don’t even need to
say that, you already realized it.

777
00:31:24,599 --> 00:31:28,747
True, Dad, but sorry—my
powers are gone.

778
00:31:28,919 --> 00:31:29,942
That’s surprising!

779
00:31:31,014 --> 00:31:32,851
Wait, wait, wait.

780
00:31:32,876 --> 00:31:35,782
Your powers are gone, Atasha?

781
00:31:36,252 --> 00:31:38,892
But in a way, that’s okay.

782
00:31:38,917 --> 00:31:43,256
At least we used them
for something good, right?

783
00:31:43,281 --> 00:31:48,853
And you found out who’s truly
loyal and trustworthy—like Je.

784
00:31:48,892 --> 00:31:51,626
But… but you know what, Tash…

785
00:31:51,651 --> 00:31:52,514
Lola Maxi?

786
00:31:52,539 --> 00:32:01,418
It’s also important to
respect people’s privacy.

787
00:32:03,435 --> 00:32:04,503
Exactly!

788
00:32:04,588 --> 00:32:06,508
That’s right, that’s right!

789
00:32:07,334 --> 00:32:08,754
True! So true!

790
00:32:08,779 --> 00:32:10,098
- Is it my turn yet?
- Oh?

791
00:32:10,249 --> 00:32:11,299
Yep, it’s your turn! Oh!

792
00:32:12,092 --> 00:32:15,417
You know what, Tash,
you don’t need superpowers!

793
00:32:16,529 --> 00:32:18,109
- You really don’t.
- Why?

794
00:32:18,428 --> 00:32:23,271
Because the only
reason I show off my body

795
00:32:23,296 --> 00:32:26,416
and my very, very handsome face—

796
00:32:27,546 --> 00:32:28,899
You’re laughing, Tito?

797
00:32:28,924 --> 00:32:30,674
No! I’m amused, that’s all!

798
00:32:30,699 --> 00:32:34,268
Because the brains and the skills?

799
00:32:34,293 --> 00:32:35,494
That’s all Tash.

800
00:32:36,557 --> 00:32:38,063
She managed everything so well!

801
00:32:38,088 --> 00:32:40,990
Mm, thank you so, so much, Kuya Je!

802
00:32:41,015 --> 00:32:42,345
- My turn!
- What?

803
00:32:42,370 --> 00:32:43,850
- You know what, guys…
- What?

804
00:32:43,875 --> 00:32:45,259
What I learned today is…

805
00:32:45,356 --> 00:32:46,176
Well, what?

806
00:32:46,527 --> 00:32:50,841
True success comes
from hard work, learning…

807
00:32:51,184 --> 00:32:51,524
Huh?

808
00:32:51,562 --> 00:32:52,844
And of course, Dad, what else?

809
00:32:52,869 --> 00:32:54,026
Dedication!

810
00:32:55,744 --> 00:33:00,256
And because of that, I became
a great massage therapist.

811
00:33:00,281 --> 00:33:02,381
Wow!

812
00:33:03,517 --> 00:33:05,464
- Wow!
- Amazing!

813
00:33:06,728 --> 00:33:07,777
Orb!

814
00:33:07,802 --> 00:33:09,388
- Orb!
- Orb!

815
00:33:10,974 --> 00:33:13,114
- Told you so!
- What?

816
00:33:13,146 --> 00:33:14,774
You totally got this!

817
00:33:15,007 --> 00:33:16,820
Of course, especially
if it’s for you!

818
00:33:16,845 --> 00:33:18,275
Tso K’s SPArtan Challenge!

819
00:33:19,103 --> 00:33:21,477
If it’s for you, I’ll push
through anything.

820
00:33:24,117 --> 00:33:25,197
Hey, Andres!

821
00:33:25,222 --> 00:33:28,010
Careful, you might hurt someone!

822
00:33:32,297 --> 00:33:33,910
You're seriously doing
that in front of me?

823
00:33:33,935 --> 00:33:35,390
- Why?
- What…?

824
00:33:35,700 --> 00:33:36,894
You’re being abusive!

825
00:33:36,919 --> 00:33:38,340
Want me to lock you up again?

826
00:33:39,573 --> 00:33:40,453
Tso K, seriously!

827
00:33:40,478 --> 00:33:41,540
Get out of here!

828
00:33:41,565 --> 00:33:43,785
- You! Show some respect!
- Chill! Chill!

829
00:33:43,810 --> 00:33:45,134
What do you mean “respict”?!

830
00:33:46,210 --> 00:33:48,030
- BFF!
- What?! Why?!

831
00:33:48,055 --> 00:33:49,719
BFF, relax. Chill out!

832
00:33:49,744 --> 00:33:52,436
Nope! That’s not
gonna work on me…

833
00:33:52,461 --> 00:33:53,338
Just let them be.

834
00:33:55,636 --> 00:33:58,483
Lord, I hope I get
something like that too.

835
00:34:01,126 --> 00:34:03,200
Even just a little, please.

836
00:34:05,980 --> 00:34:07,754
Kuya Je is so macho—

837
00:34:09,910 --> 00:34:12,658
even if he’s sweaty, he still looks good!

838
00:34:15,026 --> 00:34:17,233
BFF smells so good!

839
00:34:19,305 --> 00:34:20,665
I wonder what
cologne he’s wearing?

840
00:34:22,069 --> 00:34:23,909
Yuck, Tso K!

841
00:34:25,233 --> 00:34:26,145
- Why?
- Why?

842
00:34:26,170 --> 00:34:27,690
He’s not wearing cologne!

843
00:34:28,003 --> 00:34:28,490
Huh?

844
00:34:28,515 --> 00:34:29,498
What cologne?

845
00:34:29,523 --> 00:34:31,726
You want to know
what his cologne is?

846
00:34:31,820 --> 00:34:32,823
Whose?!

847
00:34:32,848 --> 00:34:34,648
You! Your cologne!

848
00:34:34,673 --> 00:34:35,821
Huh?!

849
00:34:35,846 --> 00:34:36,392
Why—?

850
00:34:36,417 --> 00:34:38,651
Why would I even care
about your cologne?!

851
00:34:38,676 --> 00:34:40,113
- Why are you smelling me?
- I don’t know!

852
00:34:40,299 --> 00:34:41,986
Wait, my powers are back!

853
00:34:42,522 --> 00:34:46,256
Wait—and then… Pipay,
ew, gross, Kuya Je?!

854
00:34:46,453 --> 00:34:48,315
Why? I never denied it, Tash…

855
00:34:50,470 --> 00:34:52,290
And you—what’s with the “sana all”?

856
00:34:52,315 --> 00:34:55,139
Yeah, even just half
the foam, I’d want that.

857
00:34:56,485 --> 00:34:58,398
Wow! Hold up!

858
00:34:58,651 --> 00:34:59,781
Wait, hold on, hold on!

859
00:35:01,611 --> 00:35:03,264
Wait, don’t—wait! Come here!

860
00:35:05,889 --> 00:35:07,556
Look at this one, what’s
going on in her head?

861
00:35:09,366 --> 00:35:10,606
Hold on, just a sec!

862
00:35:10,631 --> 00:35:11,613
What is going on in her head?

863
00:35:11,638 --> 00:35:14,014
Lucky for you, I just lost signal.

864
00:35:15,620 --> 00:35:17,807
Get back here, girl!

865
00:35:18,499 --> 00:35:19,410
Give me a kiss…

866
00:35:21,880 --> 00:35:22,692
Fine!

867
00:35:22,717 --> 00:35:23,578
Hey!

868
00:35:24,231 --> 00:35:24,892
What’s that?

869
00:35:24,917 --> 00:35:26,064
What do you mean “What’s that?”

870
00:35:26,183 --> 00:35:27,310
Come buy your bread later!

871
00:35:27,632 --> 00:35:29,065
Ate Hannah?!

872
00:35:29,332 --> 00:35:30,365
T-that’s your sister?

873
00:35:30,422 --> 00:35:31,235
Who’s that?

874
00:35:31,875 --> 00:35:32,552
Me?

875
00:35:32,577 --> 00:35:34,290
No. The cameraman.

876
00:35:34,315 --> 00:35:35,808
Who is he? Do you
know the cameraman?

877
00:35:35,872 --> 00:35:37,252
Miss, what are you looking for?

878
00:35:37,277 --> 00:35:40,555
Definitely not this—it
looks so cheap.

879
00:35:43,509 --> 00:35:45,416
I’m the only one
who’s gonna win here.

880
00:35:45,441 --> 00:35:47,340
Oh please, no one’s winning!

881
00:35:47,402 --> 00:35:50,782
I can beat you at anything.

882
00:35:50,807 --> 00:35:52,383
Let’s take this to tongue twisters.

883
00:35:52,408 --> 00:35:54,871
Seventy-seven silly white sharks!

884
00:35:54,896 --> 00:35:56,921
Susan stuffed the small
silo with silly soft chicks.

885
00:35:56,946 --> 00:36:00,010
She sells seashells by the seashore!

886
00:36:01,593 --> 00:36:03,493
That’s not in the script!
You’re getting on my nerves!
